---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import WikiTOC from "../../../components/WikiTOC.astro";
import WikiInfoBox from "../../../components/WikiInfoBox.astro";
import WikiAccordion from "../../../components/WikiAccordion.astro";
import WikiGallery from "../../../components/WikiGallery.astro";
import { getWikiEntry } from "../../../data/wikiEntries";

const wikiEntry = getWikiEntry("logan-foster");
---
<!-- Load Base Layout -->
<BaseLayout title="Wiki - RaccStarLogan" description="A collection of information about me, my work, and other random stuff.">
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:type" content={wikiEntry.meta.type.toLowerCase()} />
  <meta slot="head" name="wiki:tags" content={wikiEntry.meta.tags.join(",")} />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/wiki.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href={wikiEntry.stylesheet} />
  <div class="wiki-page-grid">
    <aside class="wiki-sidebar">
      <h2>Info box</h2>
      <WikiGallery
        ariaLabel="Wiki sidebar image gallery"
        images={[
          {
            src: "https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/logan/1.png",
            alt: "Logan Foster Default Outfit",
            label: "Main Outfit",
            caption: "Logan's default outfit consists of a red flannel hoodie, navy blue V-neck T-shirt, blue cuffed jeans, and red black and blue sneakers."
          },
          {
            src: "https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/logan/2.png",
            alt: "Logan Foster Winter Outfit",
            label: "Winter Outfit",
            caption: "Logan's winter outfit is practically the same as his default outfit, but with an off-white cream t-shirt underneath a thick gray winter jacket."
          },
          {
            src: "https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/logan/3.png",
            alt: "Logan Foster Nude",
            label: "Nude",
            caption: "Underneath his clothing, Logan has a heart marking right above where his heart would be. The significance is unknown, but it looks like it could be a scar of some sort."
          }
        ]}
      />
        <table>
            <tr>
              <th>Aliases / Nicknames</th>
              <td>
                <ul>
                  <li>@RaccStarLogan</li>
                  <li>log</li>
                  <li>dork</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Birthday</th>
              <td>January 1, 2005</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Gender</th>
              <td>Male</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Pronouns</th>
              <td>he/it/they</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Height</th>
              <td>5 ft 11.5 in / 182 cm</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Orientation</th>
              <td>Demiromantic Bisexual</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Species</th>
              <td>Raccoon</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Hobbies</th>
              <td>
                <ul>
                  <li>Music</li>
                  <li>Art</li>
                  <li>Writing</li>
                  <li>Urban Exploration</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Favorite Foods</th>
              <td>
                <ul>
                  <li>Fried Chicken</li>
                  <li>Reuben Sandwiches</li>
                  <li>Pizza</li>
                  <li>Cookie Dough Ice Cream</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Likes</th>
              <td>
                <ul>
                  <li>Food</li>
                  <li>Adventure</li>
                  <li>Video Games</li>
                  <li>Retro Technology</li>
                  <li>Abandoned Stuff</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <th>Dislikes</th>
              <td>
                <ul>
                  <li>Responsibility</li>
                  <li>Being told what to do</li>
                  <li>Spiders</li>
                  <li>Rotten Smells</li>
                  <li>Loud Noises</li>
                  <li>Abandonment</li>
                </ul>
              </td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      <br/>
      <h2>More links</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href={wikiEntry.href + "/gallery"}>Gallery</a></li>
        {wikiEntry.referencePackUrl && (
          <li><a href={wikiEntry.referencePackUrl} download>{wikiEntry.referencePackLabel ?? "Download References (.zip)"}</a></li>
        )}
      </ul>
    </aside>

    <main id="wiki-content" class="article-section">
    <h1>Logan Foster</h1>

    <WikiInfoBox title="Quote" variant="info">
      <p>"I'm making a comeback!"</p>
      <audio controls style="width: 100%;">
        <source src="https://media.raccstarlogan.com/wiki/assets/voices/logan.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
        Your browser does not support the audio element.
      </audio>
      <p class="wiki-gallery-caption">- Logan, voiced by me!</p>
    </WikiInfoBox>

    <p><strong>Logan</strong> is a clever but extremely reckless raccoon who stumbled into something way over his head. He's a bit of a dork, but he's got a good heart and a knack for getting out of tight situations... usually by the skin of his teeth, despite his near-total lack of self-restraint. If it weren't for that damn book, he probably would've just been a random tech-obsessed raccoon.</p>

    <div class="wiki-toc-wrapper"><WikiTOC /></div>

    <h2 id="section-1">Appearance</h2>
    <p>Logan is a raccoon with fluffy, medium blue-gray fur, a puffed out tail, and sharp blue eyes. His hair is always swooped to his left, and he has a slit in his left eyebrow, of which the origin is unknown. He has a red heart-shaped marking on his chest, which is also of unknown origin.</p>
    <p>He usually wears a navy blue t-shirt and blue jeans under a fairly thin red flannel hoodie with black sleeves, paired with red black and blue Converse sneakers that are worn from running around and getting into trouble. In colder weather, he swaps the flannel jacket for a thick, dark gray winter coat with a light gray lining, and an off-white cream t-shirt underneath.</p>

    <h2 id="section-2">Personality</h2>
    <p>Logan tends to be quite impulsive and reckless. Most people will call him stupid because of this, but he's actually pretty clever and resourceful when he wants to be. He just has a really bad habit of not thinking things through, which gets him into a lot of trouble. When first meeting him, he can be a bit shy and awkward, but given some time, he'll act somewhat derpy if he takes a liking towards you; otherwise, he doesn't talk much and can come off as standoffish. He's got quite a niche but dry sense of humor; a lot of his jokes don't land unless you specifically know what he's referencing.</p>

    <h2 id="section-3">History</h2>
    <p>Logan spent most of his childhood in <a href="/wiki/eastunder-valley">EastUnder Valley</a>, a quiet suburb of <a href="/wiki/san-bandera">San Bandera</a>, living with his single mother, <a href="/wiki/emily-reeves">Emily</a>. Life there was constantly shifting; Emily had a rough time finding a stable partner, and Logan ended up with a revilving door of "new dads," each one sticking around for a few years/months before vanishing. One in particular seemed like he'd last, but a sudden midlife crisis tore things apart. The fallout left Logan and his mom without a home midway through his sophomore year of high school.</p>
    <p>They relocated to <a href="/wiki/ashford">Ashford</a>, a rural town just up north that Logan wan't used to, but it's where he first started digging into his interest in abandoned places. There, he met a friend named <a href="/wiki/wyvern-embers">Wyvern</a>, who introduced him to paranormal investigation, weird theories, and a general fascination with the unknown. The two spent a lot of time exploring the outskirts of town, which were rumored to be more than a little... off.</p>
    <p>Eventually, financial strain forced another move, this time back to San Bandera. Logan and his mom ended up in <a href="/wiki/southport">SouthPort</a>, a neglected port-side district where Logan would eventually graduate high school. He <i>hated</i> that school; the staff were strict, the atmosphere was suffocating, but he made it through. After graduation, he found an old, abandoned mobile home and just... claimed it. Nobody stopped him, so he stayed.</p>
    <p> In 2023, Logan met his long lost brother <a href="/wiki/jesper-foster">Jesper</a> by chance at a bus stop. It didn't take long to piece together that they were related on his father <a href="/wiki/kevin-foster">Kevin</a>'s side. Without hesitation, Logan offered him a place to stay. Jesper reluctantly accepted.</p>
    <p>Not long after, Logan stumbled across a strange book hidden deep within an abandoned forest library. It was old, written in some strange, bizzare and foreign language, and it hummed with an eerie energy. He brought it home. He shouldn't have. But he did.</p>
    <p><a href="/portfolio/projects/redrift/">And that's where things really start.</a></p>

    <h2 id="section-4">Abilities</h2>
    <p>TODO: Rewrite this section from the old ToyHouse description.</p>

    <h2 id="section-5">Relationships</h2>
    <p>TODO: Figure out how to do this in a way that isn't just a boring list of "X is Y's [relation]."</p>

    <h2 id="section-6">Trivia</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>He will drink anything as long as it's not bodily fluids.</li>
      <li>He doesn't give a rat's ass about current events or celebrity gossip, leaving him mostly uncultured.</li>
      <li>He will often just goof off for the hell of it up until you tell him to stop. (May take multiple attempts.)</li>
      <li>He uses eating as a coping mechanism whenever he's upset, causing him to be decently chubby. He doesn't mind this.</li>
      <li>He's been diagnosed with Asperger's Syndrome, leaving him on the Autism spectrum. One of his schools scrubbed his diagnosis from his record because he didn't "seem autistic enough".</li>
      <li>He's <i>extremely</i> afraid of llama plushies... <a href="https://www.youtube.com/shorts/2HF6Ahrxqes" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">for some reason.</li>
    </ul>
    <br/>
  </main>
</div>
</BaseLayout>